  "notes": [
    "Regular -ER verb with a spelling change: *c→z* before *a* and *o*, to preserve the soft /s/ (or /θ/ in Spain) sound — affects the yo form of Presente (*ejerzo*, not *ejerco*) and all of Subjuntivo Presente (*ejerza, ejerzas...*)",
    "Same pattern as *vencer*, *convencer*, *torcer*",
    "Past participle: *ejercido* (regular)",
    "Means \"to practice\" (a profession) or \"to exercise\" (a right/influence) — *ejercer la medicina* (to practice medicine), *ejercer su derecho al voto* (to exercise one's right to vote), *ejercer presión* (to exert pressure)",
    "Related: *ejercicio* (exercise), *el ejercicio de la abogacía* (the practice of law)"
  ],
